://goswagger.io","size":55802,"stargazers_count":9891,"watchers_count":9891,"language":"Go","has_issues":true,"has_projects":false,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":1291,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":592,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["api","code-generator","go","golang","swagger-codegen","swagger-spec","swagger-specification"],"visibility":"public","forks":1291,"open_issues":592,"watchers":9891,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"## Problem statement\r\nDefault values for a csv parameter are translated to a `[]interface{}` instead of a `[]string`, which fails to compile.\r\n\r\n## Swagger Version\r\n\r\n\r\n## Steps to reproduce\r\n### Swagger File\r\n```yaml\r\nswagger: '2.0'\r\ninfo:\r\n  version: '1.0.0'\r\n  title: MyAPI\r\n\r\nschemes:\r\n  - https\r\nconsumes:\r\n  - application/json\r\nproduces:\r\n  - application/json\r\n\r\npaths:\r\n  /list:\r\n    get:\r\n      operationId: ListResources\r\n      parameters:\r\n        -\r\n          name: fields\r\n          in: query\r\n          description: Resource fields to select\r\n          type: array\r\n          collectionFormat: csv\r\n          uniqueItems: true\r\n          items:\r\n            type: string\r\n          default:\r\n            - first\r\n            - second\r\n            - third\r\n      responses:\r\n        200:\r\n          description: OK\r\n```\r\n\r\nThen generate the Go client: `swagger generate client --spec api.yml`\r\n\r\nThen save this Go file and run it (`go run .`)\r\n\r\n```go\r\npackage main\r\n\r\nimport (\r\n\t\"fmt\"\r\n\t\"github.com/my-test-repo/client/operations\"\r\n)\r\n\r\nfunc main() {\r\n\tparams := operations.NewListResourcesParams()\r\n\tfmt.Println(*params)\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nYou get the following error:\r\n\r\n```\r\nclient/operations/list_resources_parameters.go:28:3: cannot use fieldsDefault (type []interface {}) as type []string in field value\r\nclient/operations/list_resources_parameters.go:41:3: cannot use fieldsDefault (type []interface {}) as type []string in field value\r\nclient/operations/list_resources_parameters.go:54:3: cannot use fieldsDefault (type []interface {}) as type []string in field value\r\nclient/operations/list_resources_parameters.go:67:3: cannot use fieldsDefault (type []interface {}) as type []string in field value\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Environment\r\n```\r\n$ swagger version\r\nversion: v0.21.0\r\ncommit: 7c0fc3ee340f9d99d85573bc54a57e303a639692\r\n\r\n$ go version\r\ngo version go1.13.3 darwin/amd64\r\n```","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-swagger/go-swagger/issues/2096/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-swagger/go-swagger/issues/2096/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":4205419393,"node_id":"MDEzOkFzc2lnbmVkRXZlbnQ0MjA1NDE5Mzkz","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-swagger/go-swagger/issues/events/4205419393","actor":{"login":"fredbi","id":14262513,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262513?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredbi","html_url":"https://github.com/fredbi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredbi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredbi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredbi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredbi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredbi/subscriptions